# The frozen AI evaluation set (CP72). Its manifest hashes these files byte for byte, because a
# case edited without anybody noticing is a grounding gate quietly measuring something else —
# which is the whole reason the manifest exists. A formatter rewriting whitespace is enough to
# break that hash, and it did: `prettier --write .` reformatted the cases, the manifest stopped
# matching, and thirteen tests went red on a change nobody made to the content. Frozen means
# frozen, including against tools that only mean to tidy.
